        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions FII-SD-CFRBSS-9 9 Inch Stainless Steel Shower Door Pulls</b>\r\n<p>\r\nElegance from the simple contemporary design makes these ladder style shower doors pulls a designers choice. Available in <b>Polished or Satin finish</b>.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for First Impressions FII-SD-CFRBSS-9 Stainless Shower Pulls\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Length: 9\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 6\" Center to Center</li>\r\n<li>Pull Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Stainless Steel Tubing</li>\r\n<li>Bracket Diameter at Base: 3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nNote: These stainless steel shower door pulls are handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Lengths</b> up to 6 feet. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>Packaged with 2 door pull handles and includes the hardware for back to back mounting on 1/4\" to 1/2\" thick glass shower doors. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold as a Pair (2 Pulls)</b>\r\n</p>",
